{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43600","headline":"游长安诸寺联句 平康坊菩萨寺 书事联句 · 段成式","name":"游长安诸寺联句 平康坊菩萨寺 书事联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悉爲无事者，任被俗流憎。\n客异干时客，僧非出院僧。\n远闻疎牖磬，晓辨密龛灯。\n步触珠旛响，吟窥鉢水澄。\n句饶方外趣，游惬社中朋。\n静里已驯鸽，斋中亦好鹰。\n金涂笔是褧，彩溜纸非缯。\n锡杖已克锻，田衣从怀塍。\n占牀暂一胁，卷箔赖长肱。\n佛日初开照，魔天破几层。\n咒中陈秘计，论处正先登。\n勇带绽鍼石，危防丘井藤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43600.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43600","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}